# Agent install

Humans should use the [Docs install](/docs/install/) page and the repository
[README](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/README.md#install-okmateapp-macos).
Agents need the `okmate` binary.

## Preferred

1. Clone [github.com/koliyo/okmate](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate).
2. From the repo root:

```sh
cargo run -q --no-default-features -p okmate -- check knowledge --profile strict --format json
```

Or install the CLI with the maintainer helper documented in
[Development](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/README.md#development):
`uv run --no-dev okmate-ops install cli`.

## Confirm

```sh
okmate roots --format paths
okmate check knowledge --profile strict --format json
```

If several roots are configured, pick **one** path from `roots --format paths`
before `check` / `inspect` / `search`.
